*~

# Stray Wine drive-letter directories.
#
# LinuxMedia and LinuxHardwareStats deploy their helper scripts to a Wine path built as
# `"Z:" + homeDir`. When that path is not resolved against a real Wine prefix, .NET treats
# it as RELATIVE and creates a literal `C:` or `Z:` directory under the current working
# directory - which is this repo when the module is exercised from a build here. Harmless
# in itself, but `git add -A` would happily commit it.
/C:/
/Z:/